  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Is anyone else having an error when loading a world in VRChat and your client automatically crashes? I can log in to my home world just fine, but when I'm loading any other world, it crashes me back to my desktop. I already used that command line that deletes local registry data and when I do that I can enter worlds after having to put my username/password and being forced to the tutorial world, but it's annoying having to do this every time I want to play (the issue comes back if I close/re-open the client).  I already uninstalled/reinstall, updated my drivers, tried in both Desktop and VR, etc. I sent over a support ticket, but I'm curious to see if other people have the same problems.",
